WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
Mic check, one. [Laughter]

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.960
I can't wait for you guys to try this.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.440
For the entire month of July at Tuscan Cove,

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.820
you're gonna get the Antonio Loves Wings special.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.000
I'm with Chef Romo.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.960
We're making a chimichurri.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.800
Chef, tell me a little bit about this.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.240
We wanted to collaborate on a little hot for the summer

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.080
because it's hot.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.640
We got a little honey, a little lemon juice,

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.480
A little dried chili, a little habanero,

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.960
jalapenos, some garlic,

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.520
a little bit of cilantro to finish it off.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.600
What are we gonna taste with it?

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.040
Wings, baby, look at these wings.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.240
Come over here and take a look at that.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.080
Real good, man.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.080
That's so good.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.280
Just line them up.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.240
With that sauce right here.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.400
Let's hit it with a little bit more color.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.240
Why not?

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.400
We got Antonio's Latin wings right there, baby.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.800
Antonio loves wings.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:39.800
Ooh, that's a hot wing.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:45.210
Salud.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.050
That's sweet.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:46.970
That's my favorite right there.

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.530
I can't wait for you guys to try this.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:49.570
This is amazing.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:50.610
Come see us at Tuscan Cove.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.130
We're gonna run these [unclear].

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.770
Just ask for Antonio's wings.
